OL,3,GNEWSAJury rules man shot by police was 
OL,4,Alawfully killed                        
OL,6,FAn inquest jury has concluded a man    
OL,7,Fshot a total of seven times by two     
OL,8,Fpolice officers was lawfully killed.   
OL,10,FSergii Kuzmenko, 40, was fatally shot  
OL,11,Fwhile he was holding a knife to a      
OL,12,Fchild's throat inside a house on       
OL,13,FBorland Avenue in Carlisle in December 
OL,14,F2022.                                  
OL,16,FThe jury was told Kuzmenko, who was    
OL,17,FUkrainian and spoke limited English,   
OL,18,Fheld the knife firmly enough to leave  
OL,19,Fmarks on the child's neck.             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
