OL,3,GNEWSAJury rules man shot by police was 
OL,4,Alawfully killed                        
OL,6,FOne of the two armed Cumbria Police    
OL,7,Fofficers, who were granted anonymity to
OL,8,Fprotect their safety, told Cumbria     
OL,9,FCoroner's Court in Workington he       
OL,10,F''absolutely" believed Kuzmenko "was   
OL,11,Fgoing to stab the child''.             
